{"channelId":"UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ","row":["Blippi World",3410000,"Welcome to Blippi World !\n\nA place where kids can explore the world with everybody's best friends, Blippi. Learn how does a recycling truck work. What a baker does. What the best playground is. There are so many exciting things to explore and learn. Feed your kids’ curiosity while they learn about vehicles, animals, the natural world and so much more. Blippi helps children‘s understanding of the world and encourages vocabulary development. Blippi loves visiting exciting places such as children’s museums and the zoo! He loves singing, dancing, playing and exploring. His contagious curiosity engages young viewers in learning adventures that help them both grow and develop.\n\nDon't Forget to Subscribe for more Blippi Fun!\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ?sub_confirmation=1\n\nBrand New Blippi Episodes Every Saturday!\nhttps://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzgk_uTg08P-2LCpM-FK-_Mhb7anv2fBY&si=RrivKCxCqJ8COo3N","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:06.221Z","channelId":"UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"8f5a4202ce60c21c618e186f593e833d07673d88db853bf5a539a1c4aef7f8ca","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"46ae81b05f9cbe39f50523b02b21224bfe1d7fc037626990720e5af526bf8e74"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:02:10.549Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3410000,"raw":"3.41M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC1VCt1ecU8In4va9F27ElbQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:06.221Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],